      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. the private car service sounds like a good call for the boss. one more thing though—since this is an international trip, i'm also a bit worried about those weird little issues that pop up out of nowhere, like losing a bag or getting stuck in some random local complication that turns a quick trip into a nightmare. basically, how do we keep the whole trip from getting derailed by those unexpected, annoying little disruptions that seem to happen for no reason?",
